[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567712127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2567712127","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2567712127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZDC1_","user":{"login":"MikeSchulze","id":347037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NzAzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/347037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeSchulze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-02T12:36:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-02T12:36:33Z","body":"It occurs just on an empty project to enforce rebuilding the cache\n```\n$ $GODOT_BIN --path . -e --headless --quit-after 200\nGodot Engine v4.4.dev7.mono.official.46c8f8c5c - https://godotengine.org\n\nERROR: Do not use progress dialog (task) while flushing the message queue or using call_deferred()!\n   at: add_task (editor/progress_dialog.cpp:169)\nERROR: Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n   at: task_step (editor/progress_dialog.cpp:203)\nERROR: Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n   at: task_step (editor/progress_dialog.cpp:203)\nERROR: Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n   at: task_step (editor/progress_dialog.cpp:203)\nERROR: Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n   at: task_step (editor/progress_dialog.cpp:203)\nERROR: Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n   at: task_step (editor/progress_dialog.cpp:203)\nERROR: Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n   at: task_step (editor/progress_dialog.cpp:203)\nERROR: Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true.\n   at: end_task (editor/progress_dialog.cpp:226)\n\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567712127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600530027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2600530027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2600530027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bAPBr","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T02:52:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T02:52:42Z","body":"I think that `--headless` might be the key here, as I stumbled on this issue consistently by making `DisplayServer:window_can_draw` return `false` for any backend (e.g. `DisplayServerX11`, `DisplayServerWayland`).\n\nIt looks like `EditorNode` is using that method as a simple \"is this the headless display server\" check, which triggers extra actions, such as the one in `_begin_first_scan`:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7b1ed520bdcca21d36e25e2094802b9b33dae2c6/editor/editor_node.cpp#L5211-L5224\n\nCoincidentally, uncommenting the big `if` stops the errors.\n\nThe message queue is quite a complex beast so TIWAGOS everything I say here. My hot take is that the issue might stem from the fact that `_begin_first_scan` is called in a deferred way. Deferred calls are handled by the message queue so, while doing some other editor thing, this scan action puts new stuff to do in the queue and trips the big scary assertions.\n\nThat said, I think that the fact that it happened randomly on a \"regular\" `DisplayServer` might be influenced by the deferred nature of the call. If for whatever reason the window were to be minimized (and thus making `window_can_draw` return `false`) _exactly_ before the first scan check call dispatched, it would trigger this condition and start the first scan right away, leading to the errors. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600530027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676080469","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2676080469","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2676080469,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fgb9V","user":{"login":"MadeScientist","id":190612698,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1yE2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190612698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist","html_url":"https://github.com/MadeScientist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T07:58:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T08:01:10Z","body":"```Godot Engine v4.4.rc1.official (c) 2007-present Juan Linietsky, Ariel Manzur & Godot Contributors.\n--- Debug adapter server started on port 6006 ---\n--- GDScript language server started on port 6005 ---\n  ERROR: editor/progress_dialog.cpp:183 - Do not use progress dialog (task) while flushing the message queue or using call_deferred()!\n  ERROR: editor/progress_dialog.cpp:217 - Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n  ERROR: editor/progress_dialog.cpp:217 - Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n  ERROR: editor/progress_dialog.cpp:217 - Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n  ERROR: editor/progress_dialog.cpp:217 - Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n  ERROR: editor/progress_dialog.cpp:217 - Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n  ERROR: editor/progress_dialog.cpp:217 - Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true. Returning: canceled\n  ERROR: editor/progress_dialog.cpp:240 - Condition \"!tasks.has(p_task)\" is true.\n```\nI get this error too when sometimes starting Godot(4.4 beta3, 4.4 beta4, 4.4 rc1) first time after booting the computer. But hard to reproduce after the first startup.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676080469/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2682822385","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2682822385","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2682822385,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f6J7x","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T17:40:43Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T17:40:43Z","body":"For us I narrowed it down to a plugin that was using call_deferred. We changed\n```\neditor.get_resource_filesystem().scan.call_deferred()\n```\nto\n```\neditor.get_resource_filesystem().scan\n```\nand these errors went away.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2682822385/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2683373387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2683373387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2683373387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f8QdL","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T21:49:18Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T00:25:44Z","body":"I ended up running into this issue anyways while exporting with --headless. I built a script so you always get the error. To run, set an environment variable for your Godot console executable path to be `GODOT_EXEC`. Then open up the builds folder and run the script, and observe the errors in the output. \n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18974598/test.zip)\n\nGiven how I got the error beforehand in a plugin that had call_deferred, I think @Riteo is spot on.\n\nI'm not sure if the solution would be to change the --headless to not make any deferred calls, or to make the deferred calls not be an issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2683373387/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2683947788","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2683947788","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2683947788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f-csM","user":{"login":"mendsley","id":260055,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDA1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260055?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley","html_url":"https://github.com/mendsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-26T05:37:55Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T05:37:55Z","body":"I _think_ this originates in `NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE` of `EditorNode::_notification`\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/01545c995b0612c68f9dfce8f6cc67576c298381/editor/editor_node.cpp#L687\n\nThis eventually causes the error in the callstack (`_begin_first_scan` was tail call optimized out of the stack into `scan`):\n```\n>\tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!ProgressDialog::add_task(const String & p_task, const String & p_label, int p_steps, bool p_can_cancel) Line 183\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!EditorNode::progress_add_task(const String & p_task, const String & p_label, int p_steps, bool p_can_cancel) Line 4950\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!EditorProgress::EditorProgress(const String & p_task, const String & p_label, int p_amount, bool p_can_cancel, bool p_force_background) Line 192\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!EditorFileSystem::_first_scan_filesystem() Line 301\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!EditorFileSystem::scan() Line 1066\tC++\n \t[Inline Frame] godot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!call_with_variant_args_helper(EditorNode *) Line 315\tC++\n \t[Inline Frame] godot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!call_with_variant_args(EditorNode * p_instance, void(EditorNode::*)() p_method, const Variant * *) Line 429\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!CallableCustomMethodPointer<EditorNode,void>::call(const Variant * * p_arguments, int p_argcount, Variant & r_return_value, Callable::CallError & r_call_error) Line 109\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!Callable::callp(const Variant * * p_arguments, int p_argcount, Variant & r_return_value, Callable::CallError & r_call_error) Line 58\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!CallQueue::_call_function(const Callable & p_callable, const Variant * p_args, int p_argcount, bool p_show_error) Line 221\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!CallQueue::flush() Line 284\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!SceneTree::physics_process(double p_time) Line 536\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!Main::iteration() Line 4443\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!OS_Windows::run() Line 2062\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!widechar_main(int argc, wchar_t * * argv) Line 97\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!_main() Line 124\tC++\n \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!main(int argc, char * * argv) Line 136\tC++\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2683947788/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2685797869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2685797869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2685797869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gFgXt","user":{"login":"mendsley","id":260055,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDA1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260055?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley","html_url":"https://github.com/mendsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mendsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-26T17:57:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T17:57:09Z","body":"Caveat: While this does workaround the issue above, I'm not totally satisfied with it as a solution.\n\nMost of this appears to stem from the ProgressDialog. It looks like everything using EditorNode::progress_dialog is wrapped in a null check, so for the time I simply suppress the creation of the ProgressDialog in headless runs.\n\nIt's feels like a timing/race issue with the deferred calls in ProgressDialog. It's deferring tasks which make sense, but headless mode can end up flushing that queue much sooner than would be the case in the normal Editor flow.\n\nDisabling the ProgressDialog:\nhttps://github.com/mendsley/godot/commit/bb575543e0e81dafcd33892490e3d5046dbfcf2b","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2685797869/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2690604338","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2690604338","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2690604338,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gX10y","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T13:05:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T13:05:14Z","body":"I made a formal issue (#103398) for the case when doing a headless import, as mentioned [above](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2567712127), since I figured it might be different from the issue reported here.\n\nI also did some bisecting and found that the headless import errors is a regression caused by #93064.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2690604338/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705248413","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2705248413","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100900","id":2705248413,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hPtCd","user":{"login":"lnd1","id":160193438,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYxbng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160193438?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1","html_url":"https://github.com/lnd1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnd1/events{/privacy}","rec